" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174160/extras/03e4c98a9f4164e64bc36891369aded2.poster.avif?t=1787829620\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174160/extras/03e4c98a9f4164e64bc36891369aded2.webm?t=1787829620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174160/extras/03e4c98a9f4164e64bc36891369aded2.mp4?t=1787829620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality might be tearing apart, but that’s no excuse to dress poorly. Customize your Agent with everything from sci-fi hazard suits to stylish modern sneakers. Look sharp, even when the mission goes completely wrong.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A CAMP THAT FEELS LIKE HOME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174160/extras/d1f28004560d72d5a31aa0cb048718b7.poster.avif?t=1787829620\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174160/extras/d1f28004560d72d5a31aa0cb048718b7.webm?t=1787829620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4174160/extras/d1f28004560d72d5a31aa0cb048718b7.mp4?t=1787829620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch your breath at the HQ to patch your wounds, upgrade gear, and restock supplies. Then dive right back into hell for the next anomaly, the next key, and another story too wild for anyone back home to believe.</p>",
